{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wanted to manage your restaurant or cafe to the smallest detail ? Welcome to Mattami Restaurant &amp; Cafe Tycoon !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266a Mattami is a game where you start with a tiny humble place and work your way up. Manage your staff, their schedule and inventory to efficiently grow your restaurant as fast and as elegant as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266b Manage the staff's actions by choosing which tasks they get to perform and in which section of the restaurant they can perform them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266a Design an efficient restaurant layout to maximize output and most importantly, don't keep your customers waiting !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266b The 3D Graphics are zen, modern looking and very attractive. But you remain in charge of making your restaurant look nice, by designing it in a way that your items match in colors or make interesting patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266a Pick how many waiters and chefs to hire. But be careful !! Staff charge coins for every minute they work. Manage your funds wisely and don't overspend that way you can expand your restaurant faster !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266b Upgrade specific attributes to the staff to improve their productivity, each skill point will mean an increase in that worker's salary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266a Manage your funds wisely and don't overspend that way you can expand your restaurant faster !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266b Add more meals &amp; beverages to your restaurant menu. Increase their prices to make more money or lower them to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/makrouz_load_s.png?t=1746975602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u266a Watch the popularity of your restaurant and make sure that it's maximized for a bigger influx of customers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836500?t=1746975602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836500?t=1746975602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746975602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item